# Missions: a trick step done count times (three combos of 500 or more in the park), with a bark
# between (each): the Big 3 kickflip three times. Then Rosa (radius 60) talks at once; Esc
# (mission next all) skips the rest and chapter 1 is done.
park soma
spawn big3
cmd 0 mission start ch1 4
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
tap flip+left 202
cmd 420 teleport big3
hold up 420..520
hold ollie 586..616
tap flip+left 622
cmd 840 teleport big3
hold up 840..940
hold ollie 1006..1036
tap flip+left 1042
cmd 1300 mission next all
run 1320
expect event talk{line=ch1-14,bark=true} within 300..360
expect event talk{line=ch1-15,bark=true} within 720..780
expect event missionStep{step=5,kind=talk} within 1140..1200
expect event talk{character=rosa,line=ch1-16} within 1140..1200
expect event missionDone{mission=ch1,name=New in Town,sticker=story-ch1} within 1301..1301
expect event comboLanded count == 3
